            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great recipe but instead of frying them in oil I brushed them with Olive Oil and did them in an air fryer,put the seam down, cook for 10 minutes turning them over at the five minute mark. This recipe could be changed into so many other types of rolled tacos. I also don't like a lot of spice in my Mexican dishes, so thank you for this suggestion.",
